/Selection_of_Yerba_Mate_Gourds.JPG/500px-Selection_of_Yerba_Mate_Gourds.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Selection_of_Yerba_Mate_Gourds.JPG/1280px-Selection_of_Yerba_Mate_Gourds.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Selection_of_Yerba_Mate_Gourds.JPG/500px-Selection_of_Yerba_Mate_Gourds.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Selection of yerba mate gourds and bombillas at a street vendor in Buenos Aires, Argentina","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASelection_of_Yerba_Mate_Gourds.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Yerba_Mate_shop%2C_Puerto_Iguazu%2C_Argentina.JPG/500px-Yerba_Mate_shop%2C_Puerto_Iguazu%2C_Argentina.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Yerba_Mate_shop%2C_Puerto_Iguazu%2C_Argentina.JPG/1280px-Yerba_Mate_shop%2C_Puerto_Iguazu%2C_Argentina.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Yerba_Mate_shop%2C_Puerto_Iguazu%2C_Argentina.JPG/500px-Yerba_Mate_shop%2C_Puerto_Iguazu%2C_Argentina.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Yerba mate shop, Puerto Iguazu, Argentina","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYerba_Mate_shop%2C_Puerto_Iguazu%2C_Argentina.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Yerba_Mate_on_Market_Shelf.jpg/500px-Yerba_Mate_on_Market_Shelf.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Yerba_Mate_on_Market_Shelf.jpg/1280px-Yerba_Mate_on_Market_Shelf.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaig